   "end": 5.93,
   "overlay": [
    "time",
    "DAY 10 - 4:10 AM"
   ],
   "text": "You make Dani promise to stay hidden. Then you step out into the light.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "scene": "boone_meet",
   "start": 5.93,
   "speech_end": 10.15,
   "end": 11.35,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Boone is younger than you expected. Tired eyes. A rifle he doesn't point.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "scene": "boone_talk",
   "start": 11.35,
   "speech_end": 12.24,
   "end": 13.64,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Where's my father?",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "scene": "tell_all",
   "start": 13.64,
   "speech_end": 18.34,
   "end": 20.34,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "You tell him everything. The keys. The scratch. The walk-in. The two taps.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "scene": "boone_away",
   "start": 20.34,
   "speech_end": 24.68,
   "end": 26.28,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Two taps. He did that when I was a kid. Your turn.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "scene": "boone_away",
   "start": 26.28,
   "speech_end": 29.35,
   "end": 31.15,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "For a moment, nobody says anything. The floodlights hum.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "scene": "boone_talk",
   "start": 31.15,
   "speech_end": 34.92,
   "end": 35.92,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Then he's out here. And if he's out here, he's coming to the dam with the rest of them.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "scene": "you_ask",
   "start": 35.92,
   "speech_end": 36.62,
   "end": 37.82,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "The rest of them?",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "scene": "herd_wide",
   "start": 37.82,
   "speech_end": 43.99,
   "end": 45.19,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Every one in the county. We walk them to Harlan Dam. Lights on the whole way. They follow like it's church.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "scene": "spillway",
   "start": 45.19,
   "speech_end": 50.26,
   "end": 51.66,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "At sunrise, we open the floodgates. The spillway takes them all. Downriver. Gone.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "scene": "river_you",
   "start": 51.66,
   "speech_end": 55.39,
   "end": 56.59,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Downriver. You know that river. You grew up on it.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "scene": "river_map",
   "start": 56.59,
   "speech_end": 61.0,
   "end": 62.6,
   "overlay": [
    "count",
    "12",
    "MILES TO PINE HOLLOW"
   ],
   "text": "Twelve miles downstream from Harlan Dam is Pine Hollow. Where your mom lives.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "scene": "boone_shrug",
   "start": 62.6,
   "speech_end": 66.65,
   "end": 67.85,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Pine Hollow got evacuated on day one. It's empty. I checked the list myself.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "scene": "you_doubt",
   "start": 67.85,
   "speech_end": 70.46,
   "end": 72.46,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "He believes it. You want to believe it.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "scene": "rule6",
   "start": 72.46,
   "speech_end": 77.01,
   "end": 78.41,
   "overlay": [
    "rule",
    "RULE 6:",
    "NOT EVERY LIGHT IS SAFE"
   ],
   "text": "Rule six. Not every light is safe. Especially the ones that want you to follow.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "scene": "boone_offer",
   "start": 78.41,
   "speech_end": 82.91,
   "end": 84.11,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "Ride with me. Whatever's left of my dad, you're the last one who saw him.",
   "role": "boone"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "scene": "mirror_pickup",
   "start": 84.11,
   "speech_end": 90.89,
   "end": 92.29,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "You take the seat. In the side mirror, your pickup follows, headlights off. Dani was never good at staying hidden.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "scene": "parade",
   "start": 92.29,
   "speech_end": 97.17,
   "end": 98.77,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "All around the convoy, hundreds of them walk in the light. Calm. Like a parade.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "scene": "parade",
   "start": 98.77,
   "speech_end": 103.7,
   "end": 105.1,
   "overlay": null,
   "text": "The trucks crawl. The dead keep pace. Nobody honks. Nobody talks.",
   "role": "narrator"
  },
